IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oasda-witnesses`

-- Oaths, Affidavits and Statutory Declarations Act 2005 (WA) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, against regulations under s 18, or against the Statutory Declarations Regulations 2023 (Cth),
-- none of which is deposited.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_wa_oaths-affidavits-and-statutory-declarations-act-2005_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from
-- the text.
--
-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-daniel): d031 (24 August 2020) Daniel is admitted
-- and takes out a practising certificate; d034 (1 June 2026, aged 30) he is an authorised witness for statutory
-- declarations and affidavits. That he has held the certificate continuously since 2020 is an ASSUMPTION. His clients and
-- the other witnesses are the encoder's illustrations, not scenario events.

§ `Fixtures -- statutory declaration witnesses`

